---
description: Verify cryptographic continuity receipts and agent execution audit trails with WhiteMagic; prefer explicit wm routes or standalone verifier.
alwaysApply: false
---

When reviewing agent action receipts or task proof bundles in this project:

- Verify receipt bundles offline with `wm(route="receipts.verify", args={"bundle": <bundle_json>})`.
- Emit continuity evidence for current work with `wm(route="receipts.emit", args={"kind": "session"})`.
- For standalone verification without an MCP session, run `verify-receipt <path/to/bundle.json>`.
- Verification is always 100% offline, local-first, and zero-telemetry.
